A NOTE ON CONTRIBUTORS

This file states the copyright holder's terms. It does not, by itself, assign
anyone else's copyright. Contributions from other authors remain those
authors' copyright unless they have agreed otherwise in writing.

As of 2026-08-08, `git blame` attributes roughly a quarter of the surviving
source to a second contributor. For these terms to be unambiguous across the
whole work, each contributor needs to agree to them - a short written
confirmation is enough, and it is worth getting before this project is
distributed, sold, or licensed to anyone.

Third-party dependencies keep their own licences. This notice covers only the
source in this repository.
